Node ID=60 explanation
Text=Several years ago, I was experimenting with a new formula for a vitality potion. Unfortunately, someone tampered with the mixture, and it transformed me into a tree. I immediately dropped down roots, and have been here ever since.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Who tampered with the potion?
Go to node ID=70 Relican

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Is there a way to cure you?
Go to node ID=100 cure

