Node ID=70 Relican
Text=I believe it to have been Relican, an outcast of La Calle Perdida and an enemy of the Wielders. He was once one of us, until we discovered he was practicing the forbidden arts. We cast him out, and being the wickedly vengeful sort, he swore retribution against us. With his customary flair for the dramatic, I might add.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
