Node ID=90 calle
Text=La Calle Perdida, the Lost Street. A century ago, the Inquisition outlawed the use of heretical magic. They persecuted many innocent wizards, those possessed of non-divine spirits, regardless of whether the spirits were benign or malevolent. The wizards of Barcelona created the Lost Street as a haven for wizards not willing to flee into exile.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
