Node ID=110 Necromancy
Text=Necromancy, magic that raises the dead by placing spirits into the husks of the deceased. When placed in a lifeless body, the spirit corrupts the corpse into an abomination, creating a mindless destructive monster. The Inquisition had rooted out most of the Necromancers during the Fifth Crusade, but somehow Relican learned of these arts from lost tomes.
